    FEAT-0002: recognize customers with four interests as Community Enthusiasts

    Marketing wants a tier between Frequent Customer (3 categories) and
    Community Champion (5): a customer who has tried four of the five
    categories should be recognized before they round out the set.

    REFACTOR-0002 already gathered every rule relating interests to status
    into Customer.status, so the new tier is one more threshold there —
    register(), the waitlist path, and the catalogue seeding loop don't
    change at all.

    Updates Test 42b: c01 has four interests and now reads as a Community
    Enthusiast rather than a Frequent Customer.

diff --git a/src/Customer.ts b/src/Customer.ts
